How to avoid my extension from changing urls
Jump to bottom
kennyd98 edited this page Apr 6, 2017
·
1 revision
Sidebar extensions may be developed as single page applications, which usually are not intended to change urls. Event if you get rid of all the anchors in your UI, you are still exposed to external factors like dropping links on the extension panel. If you want to avoid navigation in your sidebar extension by dropping links, you might want to add some code like follows:
window.addEventListener("dragover", function (e) {
e = e || event;
e.preventDefault();
e.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = "none";
e.dataTransfer.dropEffect = "none";
}, false);
window.addEventListener("drop", function (e) {
e = e || event;
e.preventDefault();
e.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = "none";
e.dataTransfer.dropEffect = "none";
}, false);
